  "details": "2017.4.15f1 unity\n2019.04.01.10.09 Sdk \n\nBug title:\nWorld won’t update to new version, remains in first version of upload.\n\n\nSummary:\nTest upload with version 1.0 of world - came out successful in game\nRe-upload the world with new features and textures - refuses update and still shows version 1.0 of the world in game\n\nSteps:\n1) Closed unity, uninstalled sdk, opens unity again, reinstall sdk, tries upload new update, still showing version 1.0 in game \n\n2) Repeats steps above, this time clear Vrchat cache before upload, cleared id, uploads new update, still showing version 1.0 of world ingame\n\n3)Start new project, install sdk, clear cache, rebuild world from scratch, upload with new textures and features, upload success but refuse to show world in game and get sent home instead...\n\n4)Repeats again from first and second step on new project, results shows the same and still get sent home...",
